nowledge-point/questions "question-c05d07c3-d88b-5f15-ae17-7072be0fa8fc"] ["question-f4cb9239-3b4d-5884-8d60-86ece34323bd" :question/id #uuid "f4cb9239-3b4d-5884-8d60-86ece34323bd"] ["question-f4cb9239-3b4d-5884-8d60-86ece34323bd" :question/math-academy-id "q-159743"] ["question-f4cb9239-3b4d-5884-8d60-86ece34323bd" :question/problem "Let $X=[{X}_{1},{X}_{2}]^{T}$ be a bivariate normal random vector. The variances of ${X}_{1}$ and ${X}_{2}$ and their correlation coefficient are given by\n\n$$\n{\\sigma }_{1}^{2}=20,\\,{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}=2,\\,\\rho =-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}.\n$$\n\nGiven that the joint probability density function of $X$ is\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{1}{k}\\,exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(x-\\mu )),\n$$\n\nwhere $\\mu $ is the mean vector and $Σ$ is the corresponding covariance matrix, find the value of $k.$"] ["question-f4cb9239-3b4d-5884-8d60-86ece34323bd" :question/worked-solution "Recall that if $X=[{X}_{1},{X}_{2}]^{T}$ is a bivariate normal vector with mean vector $\\mu $ and covariance matrix $Σ,$ given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mu =(\\begin{aligned}{\\mu }_{1} \\\\ {\\mu }_{2}\\end{aligned}),\\,Σ=[\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2} & {\\sigma }_{12} \\\\ {\\sigma }_{21} & {\\sigma }_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2} & \\rho {\\sigma }_{1}{\\sigma }_{2} \\\\ \\rho {\\sigma }_{1}{\\sigma }_{2} & {\\sigma }_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${\\sigma }_{i}^{2}=\\text{Var}[{X}_{i}],$ ${\\sigma }_{12}=\\text{Cov}[{X}_{1},{X}_{2}],$ and $\\rho $ is the correlation, then the joint probability density function of $X$ is\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{1}{2\\pi \\sqrt{|Σ|}}exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(x-\\mu ))\n$$\n\nand $|Σ|$ denotes the determinant of $Σ.$\n\nUsing the given values of ${\\sigma }_{1}^{2},{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}$, and $\\rho ,$ our covariance matrix is\n\n$$\nΣ=[\\begin{aligned}20 & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\cdot \\sqrt{20}\\cdot \\sqrt{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\cdot \\sqrt{20}\\cdot \\sqrt{2} & 2\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}20 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n|Σ|=20\\cdot 2-(-2)\\cdot (-2)=36.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this value into our expression for the joint PDF, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\frac{1}{2\\pi \\sqrt{36}}exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(x-\\mu )) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12\\pi }exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(x-\\mu )).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, $k=12\\pi .$"] ["question-f4cb9239-3b4d-5884-8d60-86ece34323bd" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-3e8b48ff-d943-5ecb-9098-05bbf34d8cc8" :answer-field/id #uuid "3e8b48ff-d943-5ecb-9098-05bbf34d8cc8"] ["answer-44909d7b-b627-5b06-8717-189b1d4b5122" :answer/id #uuid "44909d7b-b627-5b06-8717-189b1d4b5122"] ["answer-44909d7b-b627-5b06-8717-189b1d4b5122" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-44909d7b-b627-5b06-8717-189b1d4b5122" :answer/value "12\\pi "] ["answer-593fcdbb-3bf7-51f3-8353-2a0bb906561b" :answer/id #uuid "593fcdbb-3bf7-51f3-8353-2a0bb906561b"] ["answer-593fcdbb-3bf7-51f3-8353-2a0bb906561b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-593fcdbb-3bf7-51f3-8353-2a0bb906561b" :answer/value "2\\pi \\sqrt{3}"] ["answer-e51b59d3-e3d9-56a2-bc23-364e27227cef" :answer/id #uuid "e51b59d3-e3d9-56a2-bc23-364e27227cef"] ["answer-e51b59d3-e3d9-56a2-bc23-364e27227cef" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e51b59d3-e3d9-56a2-bc23-364e27227cef" :answer/value "4\\pi \\sqrt{2}"] ["answer-cd5b40e6-2599-5535-a953-6e2b8d5c5bcb" :answer/id #uuid "cd5b40e6-2599-5535-a953-6e2b8d5c5bcb"] ["answer-cd5b40e6-2599-5535-a953-6e2b8d5c5bcb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-cd5b40e6-2599-5535-a953-6e2b8d5c5bcb" :answer/value "6\\pi "] ["answer-1ea11954-6a4f-5d76-99d3-931555d6a5a9" :answer/id #uuid "1ea11954-6a4f-5d76-99d3-931555d6a5a9"] ["answer-1ea11954-6a4f-5d76-99d3-931555d6a5a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-1ea11954-6a4f-5d76-99d3-931555d6a5a9" :answer/value "\\pi \\sqrt{6}"] ["answer-field-3e8b48ff