d}]=[\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2} & \\rho {\\sigma }_{1}{\\sigma }_{2} \\\\ \\rho {\\sigma }_{1}{\\sigma }_{2} & {\\sigma }_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${\\sigma }_{i}^{2}=\\text{Var}[{X}_{i}],$ ${\\sigma }_{12}=\\text{Cov}[{X}_{1},{X}_{2}],$ and $\\rho $ is the correlation, then the joint probability density function of $X$ is\n\n$$\nf({x}_{1},{x}_{2})=\\frac{1}{2\\pi \\sqrt{|Σ|}}exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(X-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(X-\\mu ))\n$$\n\nand $|Σ|$ denotes the determinant of $Σ.$\n\nUsing the given values of ${\\sigma }_{1}^{2},{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}$, and ${\\sigma }_{12},$ our covariance matrix is\n\n$$\nΣ=[\\begin{aligned}10 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n|Σ|=10\\cdot 5-5\\cdot 5=25.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this value into our expression for the joint PDF, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\frac{1}{2\\pi \\sqrt{25}}exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(x-\\mu )) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10\\pi }exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(x-\\mu )).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, $k=10\\pi .$"] [17592186092579 :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-59b192f8-8a08-5e40-93d5-ab8e3f2938f4" :answer/id #uuid "59b192f8-8a08-5e40-93d5-ab8e3f2938f4"] ["answer-59b192f8-8a08-5e40-93d5-ab8e3f2938f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-59b192f8-8a08-5e40-93d5-ab8e3f2938f4" :answer/value "10\\pi "] ["answer-0d4c0cb8-d9a4-5c3a-9a2d-8f3bcc6f2d8b" :answer/id #uuid "0d4c0cb8-d9a4-5c3a-9a2d-8f3bcc6f2d8b"] ["answer-0d4c0cb8-d9a4-5c3a-9a2d-8f3bcc6f2d8b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0d4c0cb8-d9a4-5c3a-9a2d-8f3bcc6f2d8b" :answer/value "2\\pi \\sqrt{3}"] ["answer-fca68fd5-18c4-580f-8af1-5f191fa77ca9" :answer/id #uuid "fca68fd5-18c4-580f-8af1-5f191fa77ca9"] ["answer-fca68fd5-18c4-580f-8af1-5f191fa77ca9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-fca68fd5-18c4-580f-8af1-5f191fa77ca9" :answer/value "2\\pi \\sqrt{5}"] ["answer-bb0c62a2-2941-508f-8b34-49fd4599dbf4" :answer/id #uuid "bb0c62a2-2941-508f-8b