ed}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2} & {\\sigma }_{12} \\\\ {\\sigma }_{21} & {\\sigma }_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2} & \\rho {\\sigma }_{1}{\\sigma }_{2} \\\\ \\rho {\\sigma }_{1}{\\sigma }_{2} & {\\sigma }_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${\\sigma }_{i}^{2}=\\text{Var}[{X}_{i}],$ ${\\sigma }_{12}=\\text{Cov}[{X}_{1},{X}_{2}],$ and $\\rho $ is the correlation, then the joint probability density function of $X$ is\n\n$$\nf({x}_{1},{x}_{2})=\\frac{1}{2\\pi \\sqrt{|Σ|}}exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(X-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(X-\\mu ))\n$$\n\nand $|Σ|$ denotes the determinant of $Σ.$\n\nUsing the given values of ${\\sigma }_{1}^{2},{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}$, and ${\\sigma }_{12},$ our covariance matrix is\n\n$$\nΣ=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 10\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n|Σ|=2\\cdot 10-(-4)\\cdot (-4)=4.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this value into our expression for the joint PDF, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\frac{1}{2\\pi \\sqrt{4}}exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(x-\\mu )) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4\\pi }exp(-\\frac{1}{2}(x-\\mu )^{T}\\,{Σ}^{-1}\\,(x-\\mu )).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, $k=4\\pi .$"] ["question-a7dfbbbd-1a36-5131-be23-c3a22a696cb3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-47b850ea-8926-5c8f-8acd-249aeec872ce" :answer-field/id #uuid "47b850ea-8926-5c8f-8acd-249aeec872ce"] ["answer-df425403-018d-5628-b418-23b7c205731c" :answer/id #uuid "df425403-018d-5628-b418-23b7c205731c"] ["answer-df425403-018d-5628-b418-23b7c205731c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-df425403-018d-5628-b418-23b7c205731c" :answer/value "2\\pi "] ["answer-0a0e1aba-d9b8-59e9-9c12-caf928724ca6" :answer/id #uuid "0a0e1aba-d9b8-59e9-9c12-caf928724ca6"] ["answer-0a0e1aba-d9b8-59e9-9c12-caf928724ca6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0a0e1aba-d9b8-59e9-9c12-caf928724ca6" :answer/value "4\\pi "] ["answer-e0f879ab-0152-5dc2-bd80-fa45cb37146f" :answer/id #uuid "e0f879ab-0152-5dc2-bd80-fa45cb37146f"] ["answer-